    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Federal regulations require passengers to review\nthis important information for their safety.\nCalia Safere\nSécurité\nSicherheit\nSeguridad\nHAWALAN.\nThe Colors of Paradise.\nCARD SAFETY L1011\nL-1011 Tristar\nplease do not remove card from aircraft",
      "2\nOxygen\nOxygène\nSauerstoff\nOssigeno\nOxigeno\nOguyóvo\n2\n3\nFASTEN SEAT BELT WHILE SEATED\n1\n4\nFederal law prohibits tampering\nwith any lavatory smoke detector.\nREF L10 - 8-5-10-89",
      "EXIT:\nEXIT\nEXIT\nASSESS OUTSIDE BEFORE OPENING EXIT\nX\nSLIDE/RAFT\n1\nEXIT\nEXIT:\n2\nLife vest\nGilet de calvetane\nSchwimmweste\nSalvacente\nChaleen calvavides\n(LIFE VEST LOCATED UNDER YOUR SEAT\n2\n3\n5\nEmergency exit\nSortie de secours\nNotausgang\nUscita di emergenza\nSalida de urgencia\n\"EçOSOç KIVSÚVOU\nLanding on water\nAmerrisage\nWasserung\nAmmaraggio\nAmaraje\nFam*\nпроваласа\n\u003c~x~\nIF SLIDE FAILS TO INFLATE\nAUTOMATICALLY:\nPULL\n5\n5\nTAN\n7"
    ],
